# Google Drive

## Gate

Use when the user asks to find, read, create, upload, copy, or share Drive
files/folders. Prefer Google Workspace MCP.

## Defaults

1. Search before creating a near-duplicate name in the same folder.
2. Never invent file or folder ids.
3. Prefer link-sharing changes the user named (viewer/commenter/writer).
4. Public / anyone-with-link sharing needs an explicit verb this turn.
5. Downloads and exports: use MCP download/export helpers; do not paste
   binary contents into chat.

## Refuse

- Do not delete files or folders unless the user clearly asked.
- Do not broaden sharing beyond what was requested.
